<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-542-6"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" align="center" valign="top" style="width: 100%;"> 
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #48b985;">27th-28th June 2023, Manchester</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;">We’re delighted you’ll be joining us at our <strong>Payment Security Conference</strong> on the <strong>27th &amp; 28th June</strong>. As your institution will be transitioning to the new standard, PCI DSS v4, in the next twelve months, key themes for the conference are PCI DSS v4 and continual improvement. </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;"><br />We’re putting the finishing touches to our agenda at the moment, and will share it as soon as possible but, in the meantime, here are a few highlights:</span></p> <p>‌<br /></p> <p><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong>University PCI: Complexities Abound</strong>:</span> Kevin Doar, Director, Office of Merchant Services, University of Washington</span></p> <p><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong>From PCI DSS to a Framework for Compliance</strong>:</span> Tracy Bennett, Financial PCI DSS Compliance Officer &amp; Andrew Cooper, Cyber Security Manager, University of Strathclyde</span></p> <p><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong>PCI DSS v4 Gap Analysis Workshop</strong>:</span> Dave Neild, Lead Security Consultant, Flywire</span></p> <p>‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;">We’re delighted to welcome <strong>Michael - Eddie “The Eagle” - Edwards</strong> as our closing keynote for day 1 and the agenda will also feature several panel discussions, case studies and workshops on the practicalities of PCI and wider payment security featuring clients and industry experts, as well as sessions on the importance of <strong>Getting Procurement Right</strong>, <strong>Cardholder Data Discovery</strong> and <strong>Telephony Payments</strong>.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;"><br />On the evening of 27th June, our informal networking event is being held in Cloud23, a bar with stunning views of Manchester.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Don’t forget to book your accommodation</span></strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;">Limited subsidised accommodation is available at the Hilton Deansgate Manchester at £99 inc VAT single occupancy, per night, bed and breakfast. If you haven’t done so already, please book by <a href="https://www.hilton.com/en/book/reservation/rooms/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;ctyhocn=MANDGHI&amp;arrivalDate=2023-06-26&amp;departureDate=2023-06-28&amp;groupCode=awpma&amp;room1NumAdults=1"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>clicking here</u></strong></span></a>. If you are only staying for one night only, please edit your booking to reflect the correct check in/check out dates.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;">We’ll be in contact soon with our confirmed full agenda but if you have any questions please contact <a href="mailto:sarah.christopher@flywire.com"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Sarah Christopher</u></strong></span></a>.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
